  "id": "431a4b53-647f-5f0a-b378-9735a7aa1cff",
  "slug": "holiday-guacamole",
  "name": "Holiday Guacamole",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "I tried this recipe at a friend of the family's. It is such a great twist to traditional guacamole. I wanted others to be able to try this. This not only tastes great but it looks nice as well. Don't be scared off by the ingredients, it is great with unsalted tortilla chips!",
  "cuisine": "Mexican Inspired",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Mix the onion, chile peppers, and salt in a bowl. Fold in the avocados and lime juice. Stir in pear, grapes, and pomegranate. Chill until serving."
    }
  ],
  "servings": 12,
